{"v":1,"src":"scribe+alignement","coverage":0.967,"lines":[{"text":"Lyrics : \"L'Ombre de Toi\" (Version Intense)","t":13.42,"e":26.77,"w":[["Lyrics",13.42,13.62],["L'Ombre",13.72,13.92],["de",14.02,14.12],["Toi",18.27,18.47],["Version",22.42,22.62],["Intense",26.57,26.77]],"ok":0.17},{"text":"\"Charles le bon on The beat...\"","t":30.72,"e":32.24,"w":[["Charles",30.72,30.96],["le",30.96,31.08],["bon",31.14,31.42],["on",31.49,31.69],["The",31.57,31.77],["beat",31.64,32.24]],"ok":0.67},{"text":"Dans le silence des nuits, je cherche encore ton éclat","t":35.26,"e":38.62,"w":[["Dans",35.26,35.4],["le",35.44,35.54],["silence",35.6,36.16],["des",36.22,36.36],["nuits",36.48,36.82],["je",36.9,37],["cherche",37.06,37.34],["encore",37.42,37.82],["ton",37.88,38.06],["éclat",38.24,38.62]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Chaque seconde sans toi est un poids sous mes pas","t":39.6,"e":42.98,"w":[["Chaque",39.6,39.92],["seconde",40,40.5],["sans",40.58,40.82],["toi",40.9,41.4],["est",41.48,41.7],["un",41.76,41.88],["poids",41.96,42.14],["sous",42.22,42.42],["mes",42.48,42.74],["pas",42.82,42.98]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"J'ai construit des empires, j'ai voulu toucher le ciel","t":43.96,"e":47.4,"w":[["J'ai",43.96,44.1],["construit",44.16,44.52],["des",44.58,44.94],["empires",44.98,45.58],["j'ai",45.62,45.78],["voulu",45.84,46.22],["toucher",46.34,46.82],["le",46.86,47.06],["ciel",47.12,47.4]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Mais sans ta main dans la mienne, tout devient superficiel","t":47.8,"e":51.76,"w":[["Mais",47.8,47.92],["sans",47.98,48.16],["ta",48.22,48.34],["main",48.52,48.72],["dans",48.78,48.94],["la",49.04,49.18],["mienne",49.28,49.78],["tout",49.88,50.1],["devient",50.18,50.62],["superficiel",50.7,51.76]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Le temps est un fleuve, il m'emporte loin de la rive","t":52.7,"e":56.1,"w":[["Le",52.7,52.82],["temps",52.9,53.14],["est",53.18,53.42],["un",53.46,53.6],["fleuve",53.68,54.14],["il",54.2,54.3],["m'emporte",54.36,54.96],["loin",55.02,55.28],["de",55.36,55.48],["la",55.62,55.76],["rive",55.88,56.1]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Mais ton souvenir est l'ancre, la seule force qui me motive.","t":56.8,"e":60.56,"w":[["Mais",56.8,56.92],["ton",56.96,57.14],["souvenir",57.22,57.76],["est",57.82,57.94],["l'ancre",58.02,58.46],["la",58.48,58.62],["seule",58.7,58.94],["force",59.04,59.36],["qui",59.44,59.54],["me",59.68,59.82],["motive",59.98,60.56]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"C’est toi ma seule étoile, dans cette nuit sans fin !","t":60.86,"e":64.94,"w":[["C’est",60.86,61],["toi",61.06,61.22],["ma",61.32,61.48],["seule",61.56,62.18],["étoile",62.34,63.04],["dans",63.12,63.28],["cette",63.48,63.72],["nuit",63.8,64.22],["sans",64.34,64.5],["fin",64.6,64.94]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu es le chemin, le destin, la raison de mon demain !","t":65.26,"e":69.1,"w":[["Tu",65.26,65.4],["es",65.48,65.6],["le",65.66,65.74],["chemin",65.78,66.16],["le",66.26,66.44],["destin",66.52,66.98],["la",67.08,67.26],["raison",67.34,67.82],["de",67.88,67.98],["mon",68.18,68.62],["demain",68.7,69.1]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Même si le monde s'écroule, même si les murs se brisent","t":69.64,"e":73.78,"w":[["Même",69.64,69.82],["si",69.9,70],["le",70.06,70.18],["monde",70.34,70.72],["s'écroule",70.86,71.58],["même",71.84,72],["si",72.08,72.18],["les",72.24,72.36],["murs",72.52,72.96],["se",73.04,73.16],["brisent",73.28,73.78]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Ton amour est le seul vent qui me donne sa maîtrise !","t":74,"e":78.1,"w":[["Ton",74,74.14],["amour",74.22,74.7],["est",74.74,74.92],["le",74.98,75.06],["seul",75.2,75.42],["vent",75.48,75.86],["qui",75.94,76.06],["me",76.18,76.34],["donne",76.46,76.76],["sa",76.88,77.34],["maîtrise",77.4,78.1]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Oh, reviens guider mon âme, effacer les cicatrices !","t":78.16,"e":82.4,"w":[["Oh",78.16,78.28],["reviens",78.34,78.72],["guider",78.76,79.52],["mon",79.58,79.76],["âme",79.94,80.12],["effacer",80.24,80.9],["les",80.96,81.12],["cicatrices",81.24,82.4]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"T’es le battement de mon cœur, la plus belle de mes délices !","t":82.5,"e":86.8,"w":[["T’es",82.5,82.66],["le",82.72,82.8],["battement",82.86,83.36],["de",83.46,83.86],["mon",83.96,84.12],["cœur",84.2,84.48],["la",84.52,84.6],["plus",84.74,84.98],["belle",85.04,85.26],["de",85.3,85.44],["mes",85.58,86.08],["délices",86.16,86.8]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"J'ai parcouru des mondes, j'ai évité des pièges","t":122.38,"e":126.46,"w":[["J'ai",122.38,122.58],["parcouru",122.7,123.46],["des",123.5,123.66],["mondes",123.76,124.28],["j'ai",124.56,124.84],["évité",125.04,125.64],["des",125.68,125.88],["pièges",125.94,126.46]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Ton absence est un froid qui se transforme en neige","t":126.8,"e":130.84,"w":[["Ton",126.8,126.96],["absence",127.12,127.58],["est",127.64,127.86],["un",127.9,128.02],["froid",128.1,128.48],["qui",128.58,128.68],["se",129.24,129.32],["transforme",129.46,130.06],["en",130.1,130.24],["neige",130.34,130.84]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Je t'écris ces lignes avec le sang de mes regrets","t":131.12,"e":134.66,"w":[["Je",131.12,131.24],["t'écris",131.4,131.86],["ces",131.94,132.1],["lignes",132.24,132.68],["avec",132.82,133.1],["le",133.14,133.26],["sang",133.34,133.56],["de",133.64,133.74],["mes",133.86,134.08],["regrets",134.16,134.66]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Si le ciel nous écoute, qu'il nous donne un dernier arrêt","t":135.08,"e":138.94,"w":[["Si",135.08,135.18],["le",135.24,135.38],["ciel",135.46,135.94],["nous",136.08,136.34],["écoute",136.46,136.94],["qu'il",137,137.2],["nous",137.26,137.38],["donne",137.44,137.7],["un",137.76,137.9],["dernier",137.96,138.44],["arrêt",138.58,138.94]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"On a tracé nos lignes, on a gravi chaque colline","t":139.5,"e":143.54,"w":[["On",139.5,139.6],["a",139.64,139.76],["tracé",139.82,140.64],["nos",140.72,140.86],["lignes",140.96,141.4],["on",141.48,141.62],["a",141.66,141.74],["gravi",141.78,142.5],["chaque",142.54,142.82],["colline",142.88,143.54]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Ton absence est une plaie, et c’est toi qui l’illumine !","t":143.84,"e":147.92,"w":[["Ton",143.84,143.96],["absence",144.04,144.76],["est",144.8,145.02],["une",145.1,145.26],["plaie",145.3,145.58],["et",145.7,145.86],["c’est",145.96,146.1],["toi",146.14,146.34],["qui",146.4,146.62],["l’illumine",146.98,147.92]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"L'ombre de toi…","t":148.86,"e":149.92,"w":[["L'ombre",148.86,149.4],["de",149.44,149.54],["toi",149.68,149.92]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"C’est tout ce qu’il me reste…","t":152.92,"e":154.62,"w":[["C’est",152.92,153.14],["tout",153.22,153.5],["ce",153.52,153.58],["qu’il",153.6,153.76],["me",153.82,153.98],["reste",154.06,154.62]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Ma lumière… tu es là.","t":157.16,"e":158.66,"w":[["Ma",157.16,157.26],["lumière",157.3,157.88],["tu",158.12,158.24],["es",158.28,158.36],["là",158.42,158.66]],"ok":1.0}]}